# Spanish text of the browser-tab title on every page the consuming application's people see:
# "<brand> — <page>", where <brand> is the application's own name or, with none, its
# Organization's (see ConsumerBrandNameInterceptor). {0} is the brand and is never translated.
# The plain page title lives in messages_es.po; "Sign in" and "Authorize access" have their entry
# in messages_es_login.po and messages_es_consent.po.

